{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":2,"ref":"judges 17:2","book":"judges","lang":"ha","chapter":17,"translation":"Kuma ya ce wa mahaifiyarsa: «Duba, duba ⟨kuɗa’i⟩ Guda ɗari da goma sha ɗaya na azurfar da aka ɗauka ⟨an ɗauke⟩ maka, wanda ⟨ku⟩ ka rantse, inda kuma ka faɗa a cikina fuka: 'Ga shi, azurfar ⟨את⟩ tana tare da ni; ni ne na ɗauke ta.'» Sai mahaifiyarsa ta ce: «A albarkaci ɗata ya ⟨kasance⟩ ga Yahweh.","tokens":[{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"Kuma ya ce"},{"surface":"לאמו","gloss":"wa mahaifiyarsa"},{"surface":"אלף","gloss":"duba"},{"surface":"ומאה","gloss":"ɗari"},{"surface":"הכסף","gloss":"na azurfar"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"da"},{"surface":"לקח","gloss":"an ɗauka"},{"surface":"לך","gloss":"⟨an ɗauke⟩ maka"},{"surface":"ואתי","gloss":"wanda ⟨ku⟩"},{"surface":"אלית","gloss":"ka rantse"},{"surface":"וגם","gloss":"kuma"},{"surface":"אמרת","gloss":"ka faɗa"},{"surface":"באזני","gloss":"a cikina fuka"},{"surface":"הנה","gloss":"Ga shi"},{"surface":"הכסף","gloss":"azurfar"},{"surface":"אתי","gloss":"⟨את⟩ tana tare da ni"},{"surface":"אני","gloss":"ni"},{"surface":"לקחתיו","gloss":"na ɗauke ta"},{"surface":"ותאמר","gloss":"Sai ta ce"},{"surface":"אמו","gloss":"mahaifiyarsa"},{"surface":"ברוך","gloss":"A albarkaci"},{"surface":"בני","gloss":"ɗata"},{"surface":"ליהוה","gloss":"ga Yahweh"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-12T08:05:57.435149104Z","model":"glm-5.2"}